    "summary": "- Billing periods are anchored to `StartedAt`, or `TrialEnd` for trials, and clamped to month end. `AddInterval` keeps its signature but no longer drifts. `RenewDue` renews each missed period in order, with one invoice per period, each starting where the previous one ended.\n- New tests in `internal/billing` cover month-end clamping, the Feb 29 yearly case, and the anchor. New tests in `internal/subscriptions` cover catch-up over three missed periods and a trial that ends on Jan 31. The existing tests pass.\n- `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` pass.",
